The '''Japrael system''',<ref name="USW" /> also known as the '''Onderon system''',<ref name="TSW">{{TCW|The Soft War}}</ref> was a [[star system]] located in the [[Japrael sector]] of the [[Inner Rim Territories|Inner Rim]]. It contained the [[planet]] [[Onderon]].<ref name="USW" />

